• Which components retain the most value at end of use and should be prioritised for recovery?
• What is the expected condition of each component after one lifecycle — will it be reusable as-is or require reconditioning?
• Can the disassembly sequence be designed so that high-value components are accessible early in the process?
• Are components interchangeable across product generations to maximise reuse potential?
• What identification or tracking system is needed to trace component history?